&lt;div class=&quot;warning&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Director D.C. al Fine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; unread messages, all marked &amp;quot;PRIORITY&amp;quot;. Displaying message &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; of &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;wiki-content-table&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FWD:&lt;/strong&gt; Preliminary Dossier of &amp;quot;Overwatch Council&amp;quot;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;From: &lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;wiki-email&quot;&gt;cog.viDYMELOTP|drahciRDD#cog.viDYMELOTP|drahciRDD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Director,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attached below you will find all the information we have gathered, concerning the leadership of the Security and Containment Protectorate (hereafter designated KTO-0001-Bellfather). With your approval, I can accelerate plans to activate the sleeper agents we&#039;ve embedded in the ranks of this organization and begin Liquidating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Mundus, Normalis&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
