&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-648786-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. Censorship was not done by PTOLEMY Division, and is speculated to be due to nomenclatural thaumaturgy. As it has shown no signs of cognitive or memetic hazards, it has been retained.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-648786-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. Said forces were terminated as part of post-operation cleanup. Refer to &lt;em&gt;After Action Report 654&lt;/em&gt;, appendix 1d &amp;quot;White Phosphorous Casualties&amp;quot;.&lt;/div&gt;
