one"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Plants</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://66.media.tumblr.com/ccfa61effe08a83020f2f6d4b89a8bd1/1a0fa20d687be494-01/s640x960/edabc8f4664f4a748adb026dce113778b0c40991.png" alt="edabc8f4664f4a748adb026dce113778b0c40991.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Dark&nbsp;New&nbsp;Year&nbsp;Theme</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Eyes</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://66.media.tumblr.com/0fae1cfc5c5065676bafd5101eab17e3/1a0fa20d687be494-27/s640x960/741c86cbc0935af054212607e7895346f914a8f4.png" alt="741c86cbc0935af054212607e7895346f914a8f4.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Steampunk</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;orange</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://66.media.tumblr.com/34c5894089ef2405ee0f7085c2b761df/1a0fa20d687be494-05/s640x960/d1d276d321ec92c9ba79e08bb30ad56b1a7527bf.png" alt="d1d276d321ec92c9ba79e08bb30ad56b1a7527bf.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p>Hey, I now have an art page over on the WL site! Please <a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/the-gatekeeper-s-sketchbook">head on over there</a> if you're interested in seeing works that relate to the Library!</p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="https://66.media.tumblr.com/a597a459c149473ed93bf722eca7a209/b4173400998cc714-6e/s540x810/bb3529221434be0be9d31c1425ee9717e2cbdb4e.gifv" alt="bb3529221434be0be9d31c1425ee9717e2cbdb4e.gifv" class="image" /></div> <p><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><em>March on over to the Library! Now!</em></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncertaintycrossing" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4257427&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609360472" alt="UncertaintyCrossing" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4257427)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncertaintycrossing" >UncertaintyCrossing</a></span></p> 
