&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;Foreign Esoteric Classes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following are object classes created by non-English affiliate branches of the Foundation which are considered &amp;quot;Established&amp;quot;.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-675217-4&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
