tp://www.scpwiki.com/scp-199">SCP-199</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Reality Alteration</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/not-a-seagull-proposal">not_a_seagull's Proposal</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Telepathic</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3748">SCP-3748</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Textual</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4248">SCP-4248</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4804">SCP-4804</a></td> </tr> </table> <h3><span>Additional Systems</span></h3> <p>The following subclasses are used in a variety of formats, and do not belong to a system which has been properly enunciated.</p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>Class</th> <th>Definition</th> <th>Appearances</th> </tr> <tr> <td>-Approaching/-Arriving/-Intruding/-Exited</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1463">SCP-1463</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Eigenweapon</td> <td>Item is an anomalous Weapon of Mass Destruction.</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4700">SCP-4700</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Extreme</td> <td></td> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-266">SCP-CN-266</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>(Informal)</td> <td>Item's containment or status was achieved improperly.</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4736">DEAD WEIGHT ≡ DON'T KILL THE VIBE</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>(Neutralized)</td> <td>Item has been neutralized but its effects persist.</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3519">SCP-3519</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Paradox-Apollyon</td> <td>Item will inevitably destroy mankind and can be contained by the pre-emptive destruction of human life.</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/swelling-of-the-worlds">Arbelict's Proposal</a><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-225219-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Paradox-Thaumiel</td> <td>Item has been created to totally destroy human life via a localized ZK-Class Scenario.</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/swel