&lt;p&gt;My sandbox is &lt;a href=&quot;http://topia.wikidot.com/tufto&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. I am always happy to hear critiques of things I&#039;m working on, however damning they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;My Writings:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
